      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like this is a pretty misguided breaking change that will affect lots of community scripts out there. \nLots of things include their own defines even in the unity asset store to allow packages to add additional functionality from other scripts without having hard dependencies.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
