      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My shader uses the SDK Scripting defines to lock in and this will tremendously decrease shader performance for everyone not willing to update. I don't mind if we eventually move away from the defines but we need to be in the new system for a while so people have time to update their things.\nThe average user is very slow to update and I don't want to see a master shader situation happen again.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
